    "created_at": "2025-09-12T09:07:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-12T09:07:04Z",
    "body": "Okay, thank you very much for your answers. I'll try WICG. I've already opened the proposal.\n\nBasically, we have many types of video quality, and the browser doesn't adjust requests based on quality. I don't know exactly how it adjusts the requests, but I know it loads much more than it should, even half the video. Basically, if it could limit the bandwidth and the time it takes to make requests, it would be solved.\nThe ideal solution is the Media Source API. I think this feature would be very useful. Thanks for your time. Best regards.",
